1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
This is where the Great Wall ends — in the desert.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,000
I'm your China Travel Expert.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Go far enough west and the Wall runs out of mountains.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Its last fort, Jiayuguan — the First Pass Under Heaven.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Begun in 1372 — not brick, but rammed desert earth.

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
West of its gate lies nothing but the Gobi.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,600
Double-tap if you'd stand at the Wall's final gate.

8
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:22,000
★ Expert Tip: It has its own bullet-train stop — come at sunset when the walls glow gold.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Next: the beacon towers that could warn the capital in a day.
